{"seq":3,"slug":"morphogenesis","title":"形态发生学","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/alan-turing/ideas-and-methods/morphogenesis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"patterns-in-nature","title":"自然界的图案","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/alan-turing/ideas-and-methods/morphogenesis/patterns-in-nature","wordCount":1869,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"mathematical-biology","title":"数学生物学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/alan-turing/ideas-and-methods/morphogenesis/mathematical-biology","wordCount":1841,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"形态发生学\">形态发生学</h1><p>本章阐述图灵晚年关于形态发生学的研究。图灵，试图用数学解释自然界中生物图案的形成，提出了著名的反应扩散模型；他更成为数学生物学这一交叉学科的开创者之一。两篇文档，分别阐述自然界的图案，以及数学生物学。</p>\n"}